    "detailed_description": "Have you never worked in a bar? No problem - Frank has!<br>Help him serve craft beer to thirsty and picky clients, wash glasses, clean tables and keep everybody happy!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216060/extras/edadba99cd5f4ea72f47aede3eb81600.poster.avif?t=1726908653\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216060/extras/edadba99cd5f4ea72f47aede3eb81600.webm?t=1726908653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216060/extras/edadba99cd5f4ea72f47aede3eb81600.mp4?t=1726908653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Remember to check which beer the bar guests order. Is it the new IPA on tap, that weird pineapple milkshake sour or just a pilsner? Somebody has waited too long and is complaining? Serve popcorn to keep them happy.<br>Be careful not to break any glasses while running, or else you will have to clean it up.<br>Upgrade your skills and unlock new beer types and bars.<br><br>Another Bar Game is 2-3 hours of bartending madness!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216060/extras/7015ff9ef8e3b7e2463da33f5188a5cc.poster.avif?t=1726908653\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216060/extras/7015ff9ef8e3b7e2463da33f5188a5cc.webm?t=1726908653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216060/extras/7015ff9ef8e3b7e2463da33f5188a5cc.mp4?t=1726908653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>And what\u2019s that backpack somebody left there? What will you do with it?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216060/extras/6af016bb0ad3ba348c2da7ff1952198d.poster.avif?t=1726908653\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216060/extras/6af016bb0ad3ba348c2da7ff1952198d.webm?t=1726908653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216060/extras/6af016bb0ad3ba348c2da7ff1952198d.mp4?t=1726908653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "Have you never worked in a bar? No problem - Frank has!<br>Help him serve craft beer to thirsty and picky clients, wash glasses, clean tables and keep everybody happy!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216060/extras/edadba99cd5f4ea72f47aede3eb81600.poster.avif?t=1726908653\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216060/extras/edadba99cd5f4ea72f47aede3eb81600.webm?t=1726908653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216060/extras/edadba99cd5f4ea72f47aede3eb81600.mp4?t=1726908653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Remember to check which beer the bar guests order. Is it the new IPA on tap, that weird pineapple milkshake sour or just a pilsner? Somebody has waited too long and is complaining? Serve popcorn to keep them happy.<br>Be careful not to break any glasses while running, or else you will have to clean it up.<br>Upgrade your skills and unlock new beer types and bars.<br><br>Another Bar Game is 2-3 hours of bartending madness!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216060/extras/7015ff9ef8e3b7e2463da33f5188a5cc.poster.avif?t=1726908653\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216060/extras/7015ff9ef8e3b7e2463da33f5188a5cc.webm?t=1726908653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216060/extras/7015ff9ef8e3b7e2463da33f5188a5cc.mp4?t=1726908653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>And what\u2019s that backpack somebody left there? What will you do with it?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216060/extras/6af016bb0ad3ba348c2da7ff1952198d.poster.avif?t=1726908653\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216060/extras/6af016bb0ad3ba348c2da7ff1952198d.webm?t=1726908653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216060/extras/6af016bb0ad3ba348c2da7ff1952198d.mp4?t=1726908653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "short_description": "A casual action game where you serve craft beer to thirsty bar guests. Become the most popular bartender in town! Wash glasses, clean tables and keep everybody happy!",
