    "reviews": "\u201cIt's Overcooked style mayhem as each stage ups the ante, and you must manage more things\u201d<br>Vulgar Knight<br><br>\u201cIf you feel like playing a game similar to Overcooked or that classic arcade game Tapper, then sit down for another bout of fun\u201d<br>The Gaming Outsider<br><br>\u201cI used to loooooove Tapper/Root Beer Tapper.  This looks like an expanded version of that, I'm in!\u201d<br>Random guy on Reddit<br>",
